      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f01da7dde75fcfa874a24985f01ef7ed26d5b473ecf4622b736d5bf1ca7235fe\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:797bcec07d1467f6b154cd06a0ae951c35a82a357c0aa1d65c04302edfab0635\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4eebd602df3c0491b287b8dd6b959aff46958a219616fc0fb6406b735f284c2d\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f0bbc11c518e7b12186cbb3e299572465431b350a0b8ae9d25d9acf5705f6790\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:34ef063fae18a13362a3507f707aba4e76f21e575b90163656c5d76e5ff8bdd2\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:54fbcd50e60c395bec1eafe359b5c5e20839c776956da3985b7191ea68d09b1f\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:fe20c2a5536817638907b12d9a1954091c0c4c2fba67e873439d82136714d126\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:89de40343dbeb2f4d4056037a4a89166c60ef4b69b264146af9cac8aeb32e0e7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a686ed7cfdfa406cc77f06d8ef299799dfae70205c5cae890331068fe3dfcf5b\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"choice_text\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1374,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":900,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:886:900:sha256-533232681eac9dd2c357af3b24908d4c4e8d41562c911ad7ed51eb0f4638ccd0\",\"quote\":\"does not apply\",\"start\":886},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1374:sha256-b858cc281e0b5e450bfc26c886c8d3fade5d38042c9e68a56ad496dd43eba05a\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1129,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1129:sha256-f63ba4358ff966ac514283f276f0c32e86dfc525ab2beea862985bb4ee9e53da\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1282,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1131:1282:sha256-9ab3e271d6219176b18a908e1e89635a5cbfeb67fd6a395dd3bcf59d3ad942c1\",\"quote\":\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"start\":1131},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1284:1374:sha256-767b73a5ca31a741e65fb7e179b443fe99e4fac4dbe40a0ca0c7e7df93cee56a\",\"quote\":\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":1284}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:3624f6ada5e3679051742272685ce58b4c1c7e55bed69a310f954159a6caa0e0\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a686ed7cfdfa406cc77f06d8ef299799dfae70205c5cae890331068fe3dfcf5b\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not apply\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:d5d2eb06dfb02d8ed7b8768051cce48a8fae7c2ccf98dfb62011255e303871e7\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"references\":[\"1544.219\",\"1544.221\",\"1544.223\",\"1546.211\",\"subpart B of part 1562\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:5045d3eec25810d8438cc1f92ce08310c76add1bd90d4a2535902824467ae5e9\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Applies to the carriage of firearms and other weapons on an individual's person or accessible property if the individual is law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":771,\"summary\":\"Paragraph (a) of 49 CFR 1540.111 does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
